<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>SoilSniff - Hardware</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: #0a1a0a;
      color: #e8f5e8;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    nav {
      background: rgba(10, 26, 10, 0.95);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #2d5a2d;
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .nav-brand { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #4caf50; text-decoration: none; margin-right: auto; }
    nav a { color: #a5d6a7; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 4px; transition: background 0.2s; }
    nav a:hover { background: #1b3a1b; color: #81c784; }

    .voltar {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      color: #81c784;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .voltar:hover { background: #1b3a1b; }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d2b0d 0%, #1a3a1a 50%, #0d2b0d 100%);
      padding: 4rem 2rem 3rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #2d5a2d;
    }
    .hero-icon { font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #29b6f6; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #a5d6a7; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }

    .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 2rem; }

    .custo-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #4caf50;
      color: #0a1a0a;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    /* TABELA */
    .table-wrap {
      background: #1a2a1a;
      border: 1px solid #2d5a2d;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    thead { background: #243f24; }
    thead th { padding: 1rem; text-align: left; color: #81c784; font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
    tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid #1f3a1f; transition: background 0.2s; }
    tbody tr:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    tbody tr:hover { background: #1f3a1f; }
    tbody td { padding: 1rem; color: #c8e6c9; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    tbody td:last-child { color: #4caf50; font-weight: 700; }
    .component-name { color: #e8f5e8; font-weight: 600; }
    .model-badge {
      background: #243f24;
      color: #81c784;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: monospace;
    }

    /* PINOS */
    .pinos-section {
      background: #1a2a1a;
      border: 1px solid #2d5a2d;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .pinos-section h2 { color: #81c784; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #2d5a2d; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .pino-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem; }
    .pino-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.8rem;
      background: #0d1f0d;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .pino-tag {
      background: #29b6f6;
      color: #0a1a0a;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      min-width: 36px;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: monospace;
    }
    .pino-desc { color: #a5d6a7; }

    /* ENCAPSULAMENTO */
    .encap-section {
      background: #1a2a1a;
      border: 1px solid #2d5a2d;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .encap-section h2 { color: #81c784; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #2d5a2d; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .encap-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.7rem; }
    .encap-list li { display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; align-items: flex-start; color: #a5d6a7; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .encap-list li::before { content: "🔩"; flex-shrink: 0; }

    .note-box {
      background: #1f2a0a;
      border-left: 3px solid #ffd54f;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
      color: #fff9c4;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid #2d5a2d;
      color: #5a8a5a;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav>
    <a class="nav-brand" href="../index.html">🌽 SoilSniff</a>
    <a href="../paginas/pagina1.html">🌾 Contexto</a>
    <a href="../paginas/pagina2.html">⚠️ Problema</a>
    <a href="../paginas/pagina3.html">💡 Solução</a>
    <a href="../paginas/pagina4.html">🛠️ Hardware</a>
    <a href="../paginas/pagina5.html">🧠 Algoritmo</a>
    <a href="../paginas/pagina6.html">🎮 Demo</a>
    <a href="../paginas/pagina7.html">🤝 Contribuir</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-icon">🛠️</div>
    <h1>Hardware</h1>
    <p>Componentes, esquema de ligação e encapsulamento do protótipo SoilSniff</p>
  </div>

  <div class="container">

    <a href="../index.html" class="voltar">
      <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Voltar para o início
    </a>

    <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <span class="custo-badge">💰 Custo total do protótipo: ~R$ 180</span>
    </div>

    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Componente</th>
            <th>Modelo</th>
            <th>Função</th>
            <th>Preço</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="component-name">Microcontrolador</td>
            <td><span class="model-badge">Arduino Nano</span></td>
            <td>Processamento central</td>
            <td>R$ 40</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="component-name">Sensor de amônia</td>
            <td><span class="model-badge">MQ-135</span></td>
            <td>Detecta decomposição aeróbica</td>
            <td>R$ 35</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="component-name">Sensor de metano</td>
            <td><span class="model-badge">MQ-4</span></td>
            <td>Detecta solo compactado</td>
            <td>R$ 35</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="component-name">Sensor de sulfeto</td>
            <td><span class="model-badge">MQ-136</span></td>
            <td>Detecta putrefação/doença</td>
            <td>R$ 45</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="component-name">Sensor de umidade</td>
            <td><span class="model-badge">Higrômetro</span></td>
            <td>Corrige leituras dos gases</td>
            <td>R$ 15</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="component-name">Indicação visual</td>
            <td><span class="model-badge">LED RGB</span></td>
            <td>Feedback visual imediato</td>
            <td>R$ 5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="component-name">Alimentação</td>
            <td><span class="model-badge">Bateria 9V</span></td>
            <td>Energia para ~100 leituras</td>
            <td>R$ 10</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="pinos-section">
      <h2>🔌 Esquema de Ligação (Arduino Nano)</h2>
      <div class="pino-grid">
        <div class="pino-row"><span class="pino-tag">A0</span><span class="pino-desc">MQ-135 – Sensor de amônia</span></div>
        <div class="pino-row"><span class="pino-tag">A1</span><span class="pino-desc">MQ-4 – Sensor de metano</span></div>
        <div class="pino-row"><span class="pino-tag">A2</span><span class="pino-desc">MQ-136 – Sensor de sulfeto</span></div>
        <div class="pino-row"><span class="pino-tag">A3</span><span class="pino-desc">Higrômetro de solo</span></div>
        <div class="pino-row"><span class="pino-tag">D3</span><span class="pino-desc">LED RGB – Canal Vermelho</span></div>
        <div class="pino-row"><span class="pino-tag">D4</span><span class="pino-desc">LED RGB – Canal Verde</span></div>
        <div class="pino-row"><span class="pino-tag">D5</span><span class="pino-desc">LED RGB – Canal Azul</span></div>
        <div class="pino-row"><span class="pino-tag">5V</span><span class="pino-desc">VCC de todos os sensores</span></div>
        <div class="pino-row"><span class="pino-tag">GND</span><span class="pino-desc">GND de todos os sensores</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="encap-section">
      <h2>📦 Encapsulamento</h2>
      <ul class="encap-list">
        <li>Caixa estanque feita de garrafa PET reciclável ou resina epóxi</li>
        <li>Membrana permeável a gás (tecido fino ou papel filtro) na parte inferior</li>
        <li>Eletrônica protegida contra umidade com silicone ou verniz acrílico</li>
        <li>Enterrado a 10–15 cm de profundidade, próximo às raízes do milho</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="note-box">
      ⚠️ <strong>Importante:</strong> Os sensores MQ precisam de <strong>5–10 minutos de pré-aquecimento</strong> antes de fornecer leituras precisas. O firmware já aguarda esse período automaticamente após a inicialização.
    </div>

  </div>

  <footer>
    Feito com ❤️ em Capanema-PR &nbsp;|&nbsp; SoilSniff © 2026 – MIT License
  </footer>

</body>
</html>